@PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5039

### Criar conta
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva", "cpf": "529.982.247-25"
}

###

### Criar conta - nome curto (esperado 400)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Jo", "cpf": "111.444.777-35"
}

###

### Criar conta - CPF duplicado (esperado 409)
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva", "cpf": "529.982.247-25"
}

###

### Buscar conta (troque o Guid abaixo pelo Id retornado ao criar a conta)
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/f41fcc1c-f057-4769-a195-023438f6fbca
Accept: application/json

###

### Depositar
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/6b0208b0-b135-4785-8e98-1e5bbe4ef78c/depositar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 100
}

###

### Sacar
POST {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/6b0208b0-b135-4785-8e98-1e5bbe4ef78c/sacar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "valor": 30
}

###

### Histórico de transações
GET {{PlataformaNexbank.Api_HostAddress}}/contas/6b0208b0-b135-4785-8e98-1e5bbe4ef78c/transacoes
Accept: application/json